{
  "id": "2CH.20",
  "number": "20",
  "bookId": "2CH",
  "reference": "2 Damanyoojiga 20",
  "verseCount": 29,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "20",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "2CH 20"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "20",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ng'ucheeda sea fuga Edomu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea iing'ata ng'asheesu ghapka fuga Moabu ea gea Amoni sea fiisu ng'ay bea Meuni, ghapka gang'uchi sea Yehoshafati. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gooshoohu fiisu ng'ay ak gwayeesha Yehoshafati, “Gwanda bwadaw lugooda haw leabu Edomu wunu gang'uchi sea ang'iing'i, nea gang'eena giigheawda basooda, ak ging'ulayi nighas Hasason-tamari” (was Engedi). ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghang'ut muuwda Yehoshafati, ng'ata ghang'eat gagaseada NG'UTAMIIDA, aba ng'ata gwarukuta giiluuldeaydeaba geat aba jeeda ng'eanyiida sean bea Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghabwat geat fuga sean bea Yuda ak gagaseada weeta aba heeda NG'UTAMIIDA; hean gwarina jeeda mujiinajeega sean bea Yuda ak ghapka gagaseada NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghamiinaada Yehoshafati aba bugusta fuga bwatgeat bea Yuda ea Yerusalemu, aba jeeda gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA, aba madeeda gheeda eesh, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak gwayeesha, “Ea NG'UTAMIIDA, was ASEETA ghweanigaasa, ang'iing'i muwoosi ASEETA mida humng'eeda? Ang'iing'i miihaaghwani gheambalmoojiga sean bea darooraka eemoojiga? Jeeda geatindaang'u gwanda giimuusta ea uurjeenga, nea ea manda siichea gang'alealeeweey. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neada ea mii ang'iing'i, Ea ASEETEANYA, siida ghayi aruuteawa ng'eanyiini fuga bea ng'eanyiida aba madeeda fugaagu bea Israeli, ak giidawi jeacheenga Abrahamuheeda was siidaang'u iduupcheewi damanda manda muudeanooda? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea ea niibiida jeeda, nea ea nideekneey heeda ghaydit aba gheawungaagu nea gwayeena, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "‘Inyas gaygoobisa iheengaasa munyinda, ghana ng'uta, ghana girgweageeda, ghana bayiiga, ghana geejeeda, gajeamiinaada aba madeedeaba gheawi ea aba madeadaang'u, aba gideaba gheawungaagu gwanda jeedeaba gheawi, ak gajeeyeawuseey aba sawanaduutkaasa ak abeeda gajiinya ghuusigaasa ak gayweadeasa.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghamneawa ging'ulayi, fuga Moabu ea gea Amoni ea gea giijeeda Seyiri, ghayi iideali fuga Israeli ea mang'ucheewana damanda ghayi rinna ng'eanyiida Misri, was gea ghayi siiteal ea maneekiisiina ak ghwalas uhuuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ula gayghawaleasa aba hinnooda jea ghapka gooruuteaweasa jeeda gheambalmeadaang'u, ghayi igooneasa ghoah hearaniischoodeanya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ea ASEETEANYA, ghamneawa ang'iing'i majargweaksiina saawa? Aba gideaba aseasa meendeawani uurjeenga jea eeng'ucheewana eemeetuw was fuga wunu gang'ucheewaneasa. Aseasa eara gichea eesina meanali, gheanyangaasa gang'uleey.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghamiinaada fuga sean bea Yuda aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA, sea diibiga gea nyaawa manang'i, ea gadeemga nyaawa, ea diibiga nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghawunu guroorooda NG'UTAMIIDA heeda Yahasieli was orjeeda Sakariya bea Benaya was orjeeda Yeieli, bea Mataniya was siida eemeeda fuga Lawi bea orjooga Asafu, aba bugusta fuga bwat geat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwayeesha, “Oaleaydiit ea fuga sean bea Yuda, sea fuga bea ng'eanyiida was Yerusalemu, sea sugoocheanda was Yehoshafati; Gwayeeshiineegwa NG'UTAMIIDA, ‘Adoabeali, nea adiidu goohirbabanyi aba eemeeni saang'aan; aba gideaba ng'ucheeda mii deang'wa gil gaba ASEETA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Numuji una rarang'aada ng'ucheewana; ng'ula gaygwadiyeana ng'eanyiida fiisu, ak gajanyasana muudeanooda moangoachi, gayeewda dareapcheeda Yerueli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agooga manda gichea gwajakseegwa jeeda ng'ucheeda; agooga anaawa geat ak gaba siisi miinaada aba hoorgeadaanyi, ak ghoadaayi lealeanooda NG'UTAMIIDA aba badahuukeagwa, Ea Yuda sea Yerusalemu.’ Adiidu ghoabealji nea adiidu goohirbabanyi; numuji arita ak gooweayi ang'ucheena, aba gideaba NG'UTAMIIDA gaygwanda heedeang'wa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghwahiiy gheamamdaanyi Yehoshafati ea gagul ng'eanyi, sea fuga sean bea Yuda ea fuga abiita Yerusalemu, ak ghabwat NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea fuga Lawi was orjooga Gohati sea orjooga Gorahi, ghamiinaada ak gwaduumsheesa NG'UTAMIIDA, was ASEETA fuga Israeli, aba ghuuta haw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iing'ata ghang'eatng'eat sakteayda ak gwarita gaweay jeeda dareapcheeda Dekowa; nea iinea gwarita ghamiinaada Yehoshafati ak gwayeesha, “Ooleeysiinean iita ea fuga Yuda sea fuga abiita Yerusalemu! Asisiina masaweega NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANG'WA, ak abeeda gajanyasa uurjeenga; asisiina masaweega sibangaaschi ak abeeda gajanyagaada.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iinea niihiit girgweaksiinda buuneeda, hean ghaghwal fuga jea gwasarmasa nea gwaduumsheesa NG'UTAMIIDA aba miyinda ghaydidandaanyi nea goosheedeawa lugooda nea gwayeena,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Muudeanooda gheambalmeeda Yehoshafati",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehoshafati ghoahaaghwa Yuda. Ghoang'eat giimbaliischooda nea gaba gweanyeew diktam ea damanamuut, ak goombaliischi aba gweanyeew diktam ea muut, aba Yerusalemu. Nea gheawunga ghaamwat geeguura Asuba was hudeaba Shilhi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwaat naweeda ghweandaanyi was Asa nea mang'amwana naweadaanyi; ak gwasin gida doabiiwaat aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea heetiyeada ea miyeenyarjeaweada, nea buuneeda gurooruunatka nyaawa ea miyeekeal heeda ASEETA ghweaniga nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean haleanjeeda sean ea gadiyoojiga Yehoshafati gidang'eada madeeda ea gagul gea huuydeanda, sing'oorsa jeeda damanyoojiga Yehu was orjeeda Hanani, was gea sing'oorsa jeeda gitaabooda sugoodiga Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean nea ning'ata ng'asheesu sugoocheanda Yuda was Yehoshafati gwasin duupcheeda sea Ahasiya was sugoocheanda Israeli, was dea sin munyinda haw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwaheeleesa deekta maleambajeega jea gaweay Darshishi aba ng'ata ghwadeas suurja aba Esion-geberi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghwaramoar Elieseri was orjeeda Dodafahu bea ng'eanyiida Maresha aba badayda Yehoshafati, nea gwayi, “Aba gideaba niduupcheewi Ahasiya gaygwanyarjeawi NG'UTAMIIDA haleanjoojigaagu sean ghayi iisini.” Hean gagiishachi maleambajeega ea mudu ghoamu gaweay Darshishi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.37"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
